What:           /sys/bus/spi/devices/.../pen_scan_model
Date:           November 2026
Contact:        Erwin <yzddmr7@gmail.com>
Description:
                Read-only status of optional pen scanning. Zero means the
                stream is stopped or its last acknowledged pen command
                disabled scanning; 1, 2 and 3 are M80P, N83P and P81C.
                -1 means the requested setting is not confirmed. Reading
                this attribute does not open the stream or access hardware.
                Requests remain owned by the exclusive stream ioctl.
